This is a sample OLFB.screen file.
This file will activate the POPUP window function for the OLFB
Sysop Challenge for Online FootBall v 2.0+
For more info about this file or The Sysop Challenge, read the
OLFB.guide file.

This file will work fine for BBBBS Systems.
Other systems will need to edit this file to use the POPUP window.

Line 1 > The Public Screen name your BBS uses.
Line 2 > The X factor for the Popup window
Line 3 > The Y factor for the Popup window

After editing, copy to your OLFB directory.
